    modified_response: "I will now create `/src/components/MpesaSimulator.tsx`. It handles the simulated M-Pesa transaction process using state steps (initiating push notification, waiting for customer PIN entry, verifying with Safaricom gateway) and a ticking loader to mimic real-life Safaricom network latency of 2.5 seconds, before transitioning seamlessly to the success or ticket confirmed state."
