    thinking: "**Reviewing Design Achievements**\n\nThe build completed successfully, a key milestone! Now, I am carefully reviewing the design achievements. Specifically, I am focused on compiling a concise, accurate final summary for the user, highlighting how all requirements were met, and how the design is on track.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have completed building the **DealPlate** web application UI, implementing the premium **\"High-Velocity Appetite\"** design system and the student onboarding, marketplace discovery, and payment flows.\n\n### \360\237\214\237 Design & Architectural Highlights\n\n1. **Strict Design Token Enforcement**:\n   - **Vibrant Primary Actions**: Custom-branded `#FF6B00` highlights the primary conversion paths, buttons, and active states.\n   - **Flash Urgency Badges**: `#E11D48` signals critical urgency across discount percentages, ticking timers, and stock counters.\n   - **Typographic System**: Loaded geometric **Plus Jakarta Sans** for display headings and pricing, and clean **Inter** for readable body and label tags.\n   - **Explicit Currency Convention**: Implemented a responsive custom `<Price />` element that renders currency precisely formatted as `Ksh [Amount]`.\n\n2. **Tactile Shape Language & Touch Targets**:\n   - **Touch Targets**: All interactive elements (such as onboarding inputs and shopping bag selectors) enforce a minimum height of `48px`.\n   - **Deal Cards**: Designed with a 16:9 (`aspect-video`) top banner image, a floating top-left discount badge, a `shadow-sm` depth container, and a 1px soft border.\n\n3. **Dynamic State & Payment Gateway Simulation**:\n   - **Multi-Step Onboarding**: Created a multi-step registration flow (Join Form \342\236\234 Verify University details \342\236\234 Upload Student ID with simulated camera snap confirmation).\n   - **M-Pesa Daraja Gateway Simulator**: Mimics authentic Safaricom latency (~2.5s) using sequential transaction steps (Handshake \342\236\234 STK prompt sent \342\236\234 Receipt check) before auto-routing to the pickup ticket.\n   - **Active Ticket Countdown**: Added a real-time ticking `00:14:59` checkout pickup window timer to encourage student rapid-action engagement.\n\n4. **Modular File Structure**:\n   - `src/types.ts`: Hosts strict, shared TypeScript interface definitions for robust typing.\n   - `src/data.ts`: Loaded with highly realistic Nairobi campus food data (e.g. Dominos, Artcaffe, Burger King, Zen Garden).\n   - `src/components/Price.tsx`: Handles structured display layout for student prices.\n   - `src/components/Timer.tsx`: Drives ticking urgency countdowns for deals and active tickets.\n   - `src/components/DealCard.tsx`: Standardizes feed placement and masonry flow.\n   - `src/components/MpesaSimulator.tsx`: Hosts checkout latency processing.\n   - `src/App.tsx`: Manages core routing states with smooth Framer Motion transitions (`AnimatePresence`).\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 1
      nanos: 963073253
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
